B.Ma=new A.c6("CR is your public skill standing. It moves after every battle based on fight margin and opponent strength. It sets your military title and, after your first battle, your place on Command Rankings \u2014 separate from Titanium wealth.")
B.Ld=new A.br("Rank ladder")
